---
layout: base.njk
title: "Notes — Penumbra Forge"
description: "Engineering notes, release records, and corrections from the work at Penumbra Forge."
permalink: /blog/
---

<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/blog.css?v={{ assetv }}">

{% include "header.njk" %}

<main class="blog-page blog-index" id="main-content">
  <nav class="editorial-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Studio</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>Notes</span></nav>
  <header class="blog-hero">
    <div class="editorial-kicker">The working record</div>
    <h1>Notes from<br>the work.</h1>
    <p class="blog-hero-sub">Engineering notes, release records, and corrections. How these tools are built, where they stand, and what has changed.</p>
    <a class="blog-feed-link" href="/feed.xml">Follow via RSS <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </header>

  <div class="blog-index-label"><span class="editorial-kicker">All notes</span><span class="editorial-kicker">Newest first</span></div>
  <div class="blog-post-list">
  {%- for post in collections.blog | reverse %}{% if post.data.cardTitle %}
    <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="blog-post-card">
      <div class="blog-post-meta">
        <span class="blog-post-date">{{ post.data.date | postDate }}</span>
        <span class="blog-post-read">{{ post.data.readTime }}</span>
        <span class="blog-post-tags">{%- for tag in post.data.postTags %}<span class="blog-post-tag">{{ tag }}</span>{%- endfor %}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="blog-post-summary">
        <h2 class="blog-post-title">{{ post.data.cardTitle }} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></h2>
        <p class="blog-post-excerpt">{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
      </div>
    </a>
  {% endif %}{%- endfor %}
  </div>
</main>
